OL,3,AFlights and train services cancelled in
OL,4,ABelgium due to strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of flights have been cancelled
OL,7,Fand train services have been severely
OL,8,Fdisrupted across Belgium as a result of
OL,9,Fa strike against planned austerity
OL,10,Fmeasures.
OL,12,FAll air traffic has been halted in
OL,13,FZaventem airport in the capital,
OL,14,FBrussels, as well as Charlerois, home
OL,15,Fto low-cost airlines such as Ryanair.
OL,17,FTrains and underground services have
OL,18,Falso been halted in Brussels where
OL,19,Flarge numbers of people joined a
OL,20,Fprotest march.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
