OL,3,AFlights and train services cancelled in
OL,4,ABelgium due to strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe protest comes as Prime Minister
OL,7,FBart De Wever continues talks with his
OL,8,Fcoalition allies over a budget to cut
OL,9,Fborrowing costs. King Philippe declined
OL,10,Fhis resignation earlier this month,
OL,11,Fgiving De Wever more time to negotiate.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
